  "body": "Pointing an `<input type=\"file\" webkitdirectory=\"\" />` at an empty directory causes no `change` event. Should it cause a `cancel` event? How can developers else detect when the dialog has been closed?\r\n\r\n(Forked from https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6735#issuecomment-1443836687 as requested in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6735#issuecomment-1443859361.)",
